sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Citizen
    participant A as Mobile app
    participant API as Core API
    actor O as Municipality officer

    O->>API: PATCH /reports/{report_id} {status: fixed}
    API-->>O: 200 {status, updated_at}
    loop periodic refresh
        A->>API: GET /reports/{device_report_id}
        API-->>A: {status, score, sheet_summary}
    end
    A->>A: status changed to fixed?
    A-->>U: Local notification "Your report was fixed"
